  "bookId": "GAL",
  "reference": "Magalata 3",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GAL 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu aŋaŋa, o chimwabula maana! Wayiloweli hinyi, enu antu amwekesheleluwu dehi Yesu Kristu hatooka, saŋa amupopelawu kukulusu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakeŋi kuyihula chuma chimu hohu nami, Spiritu mwatambwili nanyidimu yanshimbi, tahindi nakutiya nsaŋu yakukuhwelela himukwitiya? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munabulilidi maana? Kutachika mutachiki mudi Spiritu, mukunrishi kwenu nachisemwa chaheseki? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yina yuma yayivulu yimwadiŋi nakukabakana, komana mwayi kabakenaŋa tuhu kwenu, tahindi? Neyi dimu, komana chadiŋi chamukunkulwayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi yena wayinkaŋa a Spiritu, wakoŋaŋa nyidimu yaŋovu mukachi kenu, wachilaŋa nanyidimu yanshimbi, tahindi nakutiya nsaŋu yakukuhwelela himukwitiya?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abarahama chamwitiyiliyi Nzambi, Nzambi hakumufuukwilachu nindi hikuloŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi ilukenu nenu antu akukuhwelela diwu anyana kaAbarahama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukanda wajila, chiwatenenaŋahu dehi nawu Nzambi wakabalumuna ajentili kwikala aloŋa nakukuhwelela, hakushimuna ŋahu dehi kudi Abarahama nsaŋu yayiwahi, nindi, Nyuza yejima yakakoolekela mudeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nochu antu akukuhwelela, anakooleki dehi hamu naAbarahama wakuhweleleli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ejima akuhwelelaŋa nyidimu yanshimbi, anekali dehi akwakushiŋewa; muloŋa anasoneki nawu, Muntu wukubula kukakela nikwila yuma yejima yanasonekuwu mumukanda wanshimbi, amushiŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu chinalumbuluki chakwila nawu, hikwekala muntu wukubalumuka kwikala waloŋa nanshimbi kumesu aNzambuku. Muloŋa nawu, Mukwakuloŋa wakahanda nakwitiya kwakukuhwelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nshimbi hikukuhwelelaku; ilaŋa nawu, muntu welaŋa nshimbi diyi wakahandilamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kristu watukúulili kukushiŋa kwanshimbi kwatushiŋiluwu, nanochu chamubalumwinuwu kwikala washiŋewa hansaŋu yetwetu. Muloŋa anasoneki nawu, muntu akukudikawu kumutondu washiŋewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulonda kukooleka kwakoolekeliyi Abarahama kwakenzi hadi ajentili mudi Kristu Yesu; kulonda tutambuli Spiritu akaniniyi nakukuhwelela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu ana kwetu, hinukuhosha mwahoshaŋawu antu. Hela chitiyaŋenu chamuntu, neyi anachikoleshi dehi hiyachidiwulaŋa kudi muntu, hela kusha kwokuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yikaninu akanini Abarahama namwanindi. Hiyateneni anyana neyi kwiji amavuluku; ateneni kwawumu hohu nawu, Mwaneyi; diyi Kristu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi chinukwila nami nshimbi jenjili munahiti dehi nyaka makulakaji awana namakumi asatu nahatiyaŋeniyi Nzambi naAbarahama, hijikutwesha kujaha chitiyaŋenu chakolesheliyi Nzambuku, mwaka azeyeshi chikaninu chili chamukunkulwayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa neyi wuswana wekala kwawu kunshimbi, komana hiwakukana nawaku; ilaŋa Nzambi wamwinkeluwu Abarahama chakukana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nshimbi hichumanyi? Ajishililuku nsaŋu janyiloŋa nichamba kenza Mwana akaninuwu dehi kudi Nzambi. Nshimbi jenjili nawaŋelu kuchikasa chehaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi dinu ihaku hiihaku wawumuku; ilaŋa Nzambi diyi wumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nshimbi jalekeshaŋa yikaninu yaNzambi, tahindi? Chinjila! Neyi aheni lushimbi lwatwesheli kuhandisha, mutenowu chalala kuloŋa kwenjili kwokunshimbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa mukanda wajila wunakasi yuma yejima muŊovu yanshidi, kulonda chikaninu chakukuhwelela Yesu Kristu chiikali chambala chanawa akwitiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa hadiŋi kukuhwelela kanda kwinzi, atukasili naŋovu yanshimbi, atupatili kushika nihamba kamwekeshawu kukuhwelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi nshimbi diyi nkuluŋaŋa yetu ndo nichenjiliyi Kristu, kulonda tubalumuki kwikala aloŋa nakukuhwelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa ichi chinenzi dehi kukuhwelela, hitwekala nawa cheŋi nankuluŋaŋaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa mudi Kristu Yesu enu ejima mwela dehi anyana kaNzambi nakukuhwelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa wejima wenu ayipapatishili mwiŋili mudi Kristu, munadivwiki Kristu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hikukutwesha kwikala cheŋi kaYudeya hela kaHelenuku; hikukutwesha kwikala cheŋi nduŋu hela wabula wuduŋuku; hikukutwesha kwikala cheŋi iyala hela mumbandaku; wejima wenu munekali wumu mudi Kristu Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi munekali ambala aKristu, komana munekali dehi anyana kaAbarahama, muyanswana achikaninu.",
          "type": "text",
